OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Scotland rugby
OL,4,Ainternational to go on trial charged
OL,5,Awith rape
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former Scotland rugby international
OL,8,Fis to go on trial accused of
OL,9,Fcontrolling, abusing and raping a
OL,10,Fwoman.
OL,12,FThe charges against Tim Visser span a
OL,13,F14-year period and are alleged to have
OL,14,Fhappened in Edinburgh and elsewhere
OL,15,Fbetween 2010 and 2024.
OL,17,FTwo of the four charges state that the
OL,18,F39 year-old, who has been capped 33
OL,19,Ftimes by Scotland, raped the woman on
OL,20,Fvarious occasions.
